---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | MH / LAB" description="Exploring the frontiers of engineering, systems, and security.">
	<section class="about-container">
		<header>
			<h1>Engineering & Exploration</h1>
		</header>

		<div class="bio">
			<p>
				Welcome to <b>MH / LAB</b>. I'm MingHieu, a software engineer with a passion for understanding how complex systems work—and how to make them better.
			</p>
			<p>
				My philosophy is simple: <b>Stay curious and keep breaking things.</b> I believe the best way to learn is to dive deep, take things apart, and share those insights with the engineering community.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="contact">
			<h2>Collaborate or Say Hi</h2>
			<p>
				Always open to discussing systems architecture, security research, or new tech experiments.
			</p>
			<a href="mailto:hieulm0612@gmail.com" class="email-link">
				hieulm0612@gmail.com
			</a>
		</div>

		<div class="quote-section">
			<blockquote>
				"The art of engineering is a continuous process of learning from failures."
			</blockquote>
			<cite>— MH / LAB Philosophy</cite>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.about-container {
		padding: 4rem 0;
		max-width: 650px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	header h1 {
		font-size: 3.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	.bio p {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	.contact {
		margin: 6rem 0;
		padding: 3rem;
		background: var(--code-bg);
		border-radius: 2rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
	}

	.contact h2 {
		margin-top: 0;
		font-size: 1.8rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.email-link {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-top: 1rem;
		font-size: 1.3rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--accent);
		text-decoration: none;
		border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
		transition: border-color 0.2s;
	}

	.email-link:hover {
		border-bottom-color: var(--accent);
	}

	.quote-section {
		margin-top: 8rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	blockquote {
		border: none;
		background: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		font-size: 2rem;
		font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
		font-weight: 700;
		font-style: italic;
		line-height: 1.3;
	}

	cite {
		font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: var(--text-dim);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		header h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
		.contact { padding: 2rem; }
		blockquote { font-size: 1.5rem; }
	}
</style>
